WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Forward heavy kick creates the corner Punish Counter crumple.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.800
Crouching heavy kick launches from the crumple.

3
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.350
The target-combo high kick continues the juggle.

4
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.800
Heavy Somersault Kick raises Ryu along the wall.

5
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.300
After landing, Guile uses a second, Overdrive Somersault Kick.

6
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:06.500
Ryu lands after the two-special finish.
